{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>And Cain brought of the fruit of the ground an offering to YHWH, and Abel also brought</b> — these men understood a great secret concerning the sacrifices and the meal-offerings, and so did Noah. And our Sages said (Avodah Zarah 8a) that even Adam the first man offered an ox. This will stop the mouth of those who are bewildered by the reason for the sacrifices. And further, I will hint in it a great principle concerning the will of the Holy One, blessed be He (see Leviticus 1:9)."], :book :genesis, :voice :ramban, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T04:20:49.570007442Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}